<title>FINLAND: SANTASALO TO ISSUE PRESS RELEASE AT 0800.</title>
<headline>SANTASALO TO ISSUE PRESS RELEASE AT 0800.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Santasalo-JOT Oy said on Thursday it would issue a press release at 0800/0600 GMT and would set up a news conference at 1000/0800 GMT concerning its group structure.</p>
<p>&quot;A subject related to the group's structure will be announced,&quot; Santasalo-JOT said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company did not give more details.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
